t and=20
what don't.  This is particularly the case for quantifiers, which don't hav=
e an=20
even vaguely specified RHE in Lojban, but must have one in logic. Negations=
 seem=20
less of a problem, unless they are incorporated into a quantifier.  Of cour=
se,=20
we could add explicit parentheses, but we don't.


